OL,3,AWarning more homes will be uninsurable
OL,4,Adue to flood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes are being built today that could
OL,7,Fbecome uninsurable in the future due to
OL,8,Fthe risk of flooding, the boss of
OL,9,Finsurance giant Aviva has said.
OL,11,FAmanda Blanc said the risk of flooding
OL,12,Fis "absolutely increasing", but based
OL,13,Fon current building patterns 115,000
OL,14,Fnew homes will be built in flood zones
OL,15,Fin the next decade.
OL,17,F"That doesn't seem to me to make sense.
OL,18,FWe need to think about where those
OL,19,Fhomes are being built," she told the
OL,20,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
