OL,3,AWarning more homes will be uninsurable
OL,4,Adue to flood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 6.3 million homes and businesses
OL,7,Fin England are at risk of flooding,
OL,8,Faccording to the Environment Agency,
OL,9,Fand Aviva research found one in nine
OL,10,Fhomes built between 2022 and 2024 are
OL,11,Fat medium to high risk of flooding.
